# Controls sdist (.tar.gz) contents only; the wheel is unaffected.
#
# setuptools-scm installs a file-finder that replaces setuptools' default sdist
# file set with "everything git tracks under sdk/python". That silently pulled
# examples/ (including quickstart.ipynb) into the sdist, which was never shipped
# before the setuptools-scm migration. They are documentation, not runtime code.
prune examples
